script KiposTown_Zoo_EnvironmentSign_FungalSwamp
{
    lock
    msgbox(format("Enclosure No. 5: {COLOR GREEN}Fungal Swamp{COLOR DARK_GRAY}\p Fungi play crucial roles in our ecosystems, from associations with plant roots to decomposing all sorts of matter. Despite their importance, we know relatively little about fungi! That's why, here at the Sunset Wildlife Conservation Center, we've dedicated an entire display to fungi and the Pokémon that surround them.\p {COLOR GREEN}Bug, Dark, and Poison-type{COLOR DARK_GRAY} Pokémon are commonly associated with fungal growth. Other Pokémon associated with {COLOR GREEN}trickery{COLOR DARK_GRAY} or {COLOR GREEN}decay{COLOR DARK_GRAY} are also perfect for this environment!"))
    closemessage
    release
    end
}

